    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A new sequel of the successful <strong>Unlock The King</strong>, now with 3D boards based on <strong>Rubik's Cubes</strong>. An originally designed puzzle game inspired by chess. Move the pieces and create a path to <strong>Unlock the King</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Brand new gameplay mechanics based on the Rubik's cube;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Originally designed concept, including electronic board, lightning-fast piece movements, trigger buttons, and movable parts; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 50 original design levels; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Original soundtrack;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Designed for Unlock The King fans and newcomers alike.</p></li></ul>",
